get.description:
Retrieve an order by order ID which you receive in the order notification.

{% callout variant="info" %}
If `replace-items` was recently called for this order, the response may not yet reflect the updated items. Item replacement is processed asynchronously — allow a short delay before re-fetching the order.
{% /callout %}

schema.description:
{% callout variant="info" %}
With Order V2, a more detailed breakdown of pricing of the order is provided.
The pricing structure (all of it, or some of it) may be required for order creation in the POS system, taking into account the proper mapping of discounts.

Please note that any enum defined may get additional values at any point in time.
Moreover, additional JSON properties may be added.
{% /callout %}

subtotal_basket_discounts.description:
Total amount of basket discounts applied.
Represents discounts applied to the total basket amount due to basket value targeted campaigns.

{% callout variant="info" %}
An order can have multiple basket campaigns applied to it.
{% /callout %}

subtotal_item_discounts.description:
Total amount of item discounts applied.
Represents discounts applied to the items in the order due to item-targeted campaigns such as Buy One Get One.

{% callout variant="info" %}
An order can have multiple item campaigns applied to it.
{% /callout %}

subtotal_basket_discounts.description:
The proportional part of this option value's price from the sum of all basket discounts applied to the order.

{% callout variant="info" %}
This field can be used to assign a partial value of basket discount to this option value, for accounting purposes, if need be.
{% /callout %}

subtotal_item_discounts.description:
The proportional part of this option value's price from the sum of all item discounts applied to its parent item.

{% callout variant="info" %}
This field can be used to assign a partial value of the item discount to this option value, for accounting purposes, if need be.
{% /callout %}

subtotal_basket_discounts.description:
The proportional part of this item's price from the sum of all basket discounts applied to the order.

{% callout variant="info" %}
* This value includes all `option.subtotal_basket_discount` connected to this item.
* This field can be used to assign a partial value of basket discount to this item's price, for accounting purposes, if need be.
{% /callout %}

subtotal_item_discounts.description:
The sum of any item discounts applied, proportional to the item's price.

{% callout variant="info" %}
This value includes all `option.subtotal_item_discount` connected to this item.
{% /callout %}

is_bundle_offer.description:
Indicates that this is a bundle offer.

{% callout variant="info" %}
Only applicable for `item_type`:
- `order-item`
{% /callout %}

substitution_settings.description:
Consumer's substitution preferences for the item.

{% callout variant="info" %}
Only applicable for `item_type`:
- `order-retail-item`
{% /callout %}

weight_details.description:
Weight details of a weight based item.

{% callout variant="info" %}
Only applicable for `item_type`:
- `order-retail-item`
{% /callout %}

item_additions.description:
**AVAILABLE UPON REQUEST ONLY**

Free or promotional items to add to the order without replacing existing items.

{% callout variant="warning" %}
Contact Wolt support to request access.
{% /callout %}

